---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Each Rotary year in review
description: What the Rotary clubs of District 3110 did in each Rotary year, by area of focus, Avenue of Service and club.
permalink: /years/
---
<div class="wrap section narrow">
  <h1>{{ t.years.title }}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{{ t.years.intro }}</p>
  <ul class="report-list">
    {%- for y in site.years %}
    <li><a href="{{ y.url }}"><strong>Rotary year {{ y.year }}</strong></a>{% if y.current %} <span class="chip chip-running">{{ t.years.so_far }}</span>{% endif %}<br>
      <span class="small muted">{{ y.activities | number }} {{ 'activity' if y.activities == 1 else 'activities' }} from {{ y.clubsPosting }} {{ 'club' if y.clubsPosting == 1 else 'clubs' }}{% if y.peopleHelped %} · {{ y.peopleHelped | number }} people helped{% endif %}</span></li>
    {%- else %}
    <li>No activities yet.</li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
